<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens vs dollar, steady on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens vs dollar, steady on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was weaker against the dollar and steady against the pound sterling on Tuesday, reflecting both international trends and local market conditions, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a commercial mean rate of 20.9575 to the dollar from 20.9325 on Monday, and at 35.344 to the pound from 35.354.</p>
</text>
